OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain and
OL,6,Fshowers will become lighter and more
OL,7,Fisolated through the evening, with
OL,8,Fsome clear spells developing from the
OL,9,Fwest. Most areas should be dry by the
OL,10,Fend of the night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FGenerally dry and bright
OL,13,Fthrough the morning. Scattered showers
OL,14,Fwill develop during the afternoon,
OL,15,Fespecially in the west where they may
OL,16,Fbe heavy, before gradually spreading
OL,17,Feastwards into the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
