OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,6,Fbreezy with sunny spells and scattered
OL,7,Fshowers, locally heavy. Some hazy
OL,8,Fsunshine on Tuesday, though becoming
OL,9,Fbreezy with rain spreading south-
OL,10,Feastwards late afternoon. Mostly dry
OL,11,Fand sunny on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
